  "source_statement": "Let ABC be an acute triangle with circumcircle Γ. Let the internal angle bisector of ∠BAC intersect BC and Γ at E and N , respectively. Let A0 be the antipode of A on Γ and let V be the point where AA0 intersects BC. Given that EV = 6, V A0 = 7, and A0 N = 9, compute the radius of Γ.",
